seg-ad2c4ff087a8 = It is a draw, not the climate: its availability differs from the statistical one by the draw's sampling error, and the first episode is drawn whole. The result carries <c1/>, <c2/>, <c3/> and <c4/> per step and a <c5/> block (availability, cloud fraction, outage count, longest outage). <b>MODELLED</b>; the checks (<c6/>, bars fixed in <c7/> before the first run) are determinism and consistency with the stated figures, not an external oracle. Without the table nothing is written and the result is the { "0.37" } document.

