# text
# c1: optical_availability
seg-73dcf0f31fe9 = No weather dataset is bundled. Cloud-climate inputs for a real site would come from a public dataset (Copernicus ERA5, NASA MODIS or ISCCP); each dataset's licence has to be read and recorded before use, and raw data fetched at test time with a pinned SHA-256. The one climatology already in the repository is the Cavazzani et al. clear-night table used by <c1/>.

